# Walkthrough: Evario Odyssey (Final Character Polish)

The player character has been fully polished with refined visuals and improved animation dynamics.

## Visual & Animation Polish
- **Clean Sprite Rendering**: Removed all artificial overlays (white boxes) to showcase the original high-quality pixel art.
- **Natural Walking Cycle**: The animation speed has been halved (from 0.15 to 0.08) to provide a more weighted and natural walking feel.
- **Dynamic Pulsing Glow**: Added a sine-wave based pulsing glow effect that makes the character feel alive and premium.
- **Perfect Orientation**: The character always faces her movement direction with zero delay.

